    "rating": 4.7,
    "reference": "ChIJRVUROFA3yUwRfc7bYNLca_0",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Adam Brenn",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100792657819744901544/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnbKjW8Ov95qgOcOxJ7CuCD3dFqN2ezhSCbfVazmhOaPNGKm87Jw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "First off, it’s great to have a local game store in town, but even better when visiting is a pleasant experience. They constantly have different events going on for a variety of trading card games, but they also have a massive inventory spread across all sorts of collectibles. I definitely recommend stopping by and checking it out. If you’re interested in playing Magic: The Gathering, this is the place to be, everyone is super friendly.",
        "time": 1758316824,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Morgan Assante",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114626527808125580371/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXTMnHg3uzJg9tObiMvijrqw1XnGrGq8ZDXXT7r8-UKTKSeNVqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Great local card spot — tons of Pokemon bulk stacks. Spent awhile going through them and chatting with the girls there! All of whom were lovely and gave us great recommendations of spots to eat. Single cards / ALT arts are a little high in price but hospitality and kindness are always worth paying for in these types of spots.",
        "time": 1756330326,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Suzannah Nicholson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104658640249912974316/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVRnCtM82nMSb6MFG-Ui7Qn-99cBYTIL4DcZzmskAo-v10aAeN7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Staff are nice, they have good stock, and they have a great space to play Pokémon and MTG!\nIt’s nice that they also have snacks for sale if you’re playing a game:",
        "time": 1758317255,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Trevor Cole Chevrier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104206819174850489001/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJSDl6_kPi81C55AQyb88VNkheRPDnYmpJPPYHRQKjpYvtUNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "All products are massively overpriced and a clear sign of scalping. Every bulk card has been bumped up in price, including their bin of EX’s from modern sets at $5 MINIMUM. Sad to see my favourite local store hit by the wave, and they should honestly set a better example. Do not shop here. Attached is a photo of them unironically removing the packs from sealed mini portfolios to min max their inventory. shameless and terrible practice.",
        "time": 1754948906,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Reem Odeh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101664540325906895875/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIO4rCygZ5a9Ox3JTBxzqgv7A5J7vbTAv0-hat4wipfFkyP8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Universe Collectables has the coolest cards! Their selection is amazing, and the staff are super friendly and helpful. Always a great experience shopping here!",
        "time": 1755998766,
        "translated": false
      }
